---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import { gardenPosts, topicDescriptions, topicUrl, growthLabels } from '../utils/garden';
const posts = await gardenPosts();
---
<Layout title="瑞安漂流日记" active="home">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">一座持续生长的个人花园</p><h1>在漂流中记录，<br />让想法<em>慢慢生长。</em></h1><p class="hero-description">阅读、投资、学习与生活。<br />把零散的发现写下来，留给未来的自己，<br class="desktop-break" />也分享给偶然路过的你。</p><a class="text-link" href="/posts/">走进花园 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="garden-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 420 350" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <ellipse cx="220" cy="304" rx="130" ry="11" fill="#e6e4d6" />
        <path d="M115 290C115 219 154 187 150 139C146 94 163 66 185 36M215 288C213 242 209 205 234 168C256 135 269 96 270 65M308 294C315 258 315 229 302 197" stroke="#536e50" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M139 190C99 185 93 150 100 143C132 148 149 164 139 190ZM146 145C184 143 194 111 187 104C156 106 141 122 146 145ZM157 90C130 82 132 53 139 49C163 58 166 74 157 90ZM214 247C178 244 167 211 173 206C204 208 220 224 214 247ZM231 176C267 181 285 155 280 144C250 138 232 151 231 176ZM257 119C233 113 225 91 230 85C253 85 266 101 257 119ZM309 258C340 258 350 239 346 232C321 231 308 240 309 258ZM302 198C286 193 279 180 280 170C299 170 312 181 302 198Z" fill="#b7c2a3" stroke="#536e50" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <g stroke="#b37860" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M182 39C159 32 164 16 178 21C176 1 193 0 195 18C212 5 221 21 206 31C224 42 212 54 198 44C196 62 179 57 182 39Z" fill="#e7c8b3"/><circle cx="193" cy="32" r="5" fill="#c89068"/></g>
        <g stroke="#786f8e" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M258 66C243 52 252 40 264 48C265 31 279 34 278 48C293 42 298 55 285 61C299 71 289 82 277 72C272 87 259 82 263 69Z" fill="#d4cbdc"/><circle cx="271" cy="61" r="4" fill="#d9b881"/></g>
        <path d="M70 300C144 290 255 293 360 302M101 307H323" stroke="#948e70" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <path d="M51 108L55 98L59 108L69 112L59 116L55 126L51 116L41 112Z" fill="#c5b887"/><circle cx="352" cy="132" r="3" fill="#b7c2a3"/><circle cx="86" cy="229" r="2" fill="#b37860"/>
      </svg><span class="illustration-caption">每一种生长，都有自己的节奏。</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="garden-intro shell"><span class="section-number">01 / THE GARDEN</span><div><h2>想法不必等到完整，<br />才值得被留下。</h2><p>这里收录成长记录、主题手记和阶段回顾。有些刚刚发芽，有些还在整理，也有些会在回看中继续修订。</p></div><div class="growth-key">{Object.entries(growthLabels).map(([key, label]) => <span><i class={`growth-dot ${key}`}></i>{label}</span>)}<small>标记内容的成熟程度，不是进步的分数。</small></div></section>
  <section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENTLY PLANTED</p><h2>最近写下来的</h2></div><a class="quiet-link" href="/posts/">查看花园 ↗</a></div>{posts.length ? <div class="post-grid">{posts.slice(0, 6).map(post => <PostCard post={post} />)}</div> : <div class="empty-state"><span aria-hidden="true">❧</span><h3>留一片空地，给第一篇记录。</h3><p>这里还没有公开文章。写好、检查过，再慢慢种下。</p><a class="quiet-link" href="/about/">了解这座花园 ↗</a></div>}</section>
  <section class="section topics-section shell"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PATHS TO WANDER</p><h2>沿着一个主题走走</h2></div><a class="quiet-link" href="/topics/">全部主题 ↗</a></div><div class="topic-grid">{Object.entries(topicDescriptions).map(([topic, description], index) => <a class="topic-tile" href={topicUrl(topic)}><span class="topic-index">0{index + 1}</span><h3>{topic}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>{description}</p></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="personal-note shell"><span class="note-flower" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h2>你好，我是瑞安。</h2><p>想留下长期积累的过程，也留下那些后来改变了的看法。<br />愿这座小花园，能陪我走得久一点。</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">关于我与这座花园 ↗</a></div></section>
</Layout>
